# Google Maps Platform API Key (SvelteKit public env var via $env/dynamic/public)
#
# Option 1 (Free Zero-Billing Prototyping - Maps Demo Key):
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card or Cloud project required).
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted.
# 4. Generate/reveal your Demo Key and paste it below.
#    Note: Maps Demo Keys have daily quota limits and are for prototyping only.
#
# Option 2 (Production - Google Cloud Project API Key):
# 1. Create a key at https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, Geocoding API, Elevation API, and Weather API.
# 3. Restrict the key by HTTP referrer and allowed APIs before deploying.
PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
